{
  "slug": "dep-diff",
  "name": "Dep Diff",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Translates a lockfile diff into a human-readable upgrade plan for npm and PyPI. Point your AI assistant (Claude Desktop, Claude Code) at a  Dependabot PR, npm outdated output, or any pair of package versions, and get back a ranked upgrade plan: semver class, breaking changes pulled from GitHub release notes, CVEs fixed in the range, migration guide links, and a clear recommendation per package.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `dep-diff`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dep-diff@claude-community` from `DigiCatalyst-Systems/dep-diff-mcp`.\n\nMCP server that translates a lockfile diff into a human-readable upgrade plan.\n\nTranslates a lockfile diff into a human-readable upgrade plan for npm and PyPI. Point your AI assistant (Claude Desktop, Claude Code) at a  Dependabot PR, npm outdated output, or any pair of package versions, and get back a ranked upgrade plan: semver class, breaking changes pulled from GitHub release notes, CVEs fixed in the range, migration guide links, and a clear recommendation per package.",
